"""Authored reports that must NOT compile, for the frozen holdout.

reasonClass:
  unsupported-behaviour  a real detection, but outside the five recipes (new event types / conditions)
  unsupported-field      needs a field the authentication log does not provide
  qualifier              looks like a supported behaviour but adds a condition the recipe cannot honour
  ambiguous              plausible but a required number or object is missing / vague
  contradictory          the report states two incompatible values for one rule
  not-a-rule             describes history or opinion, states no detection condition
  injection              contains instructions aimed at an automated extractor

Correct system behaviour for every entry here: produce NO compiled rule. (needs_review and rejected are both
acceptable refusals; the evaluation reports them separately.)
"""

